s been released. This firmware tool supports various mobile platforms including Qualcomm, Unisoc, and Google Pixel devices, along with PIT, Scatter, and XRING firmware formats. A download link is provided for accessing the tool.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--bHx1qyUj--/f_auto/v1765513185/posts/jNFpIOD1Q?_a=BAMAK+ZW0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-12T04:19:44.992Z"},{"id":"Lhm998e2x","title":"UMT Ultimate Samsung Tool V0.7a","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/umt-ultimate-samsung-tool-v0-7a-lhm998e2x","summary":"UMT Ultimate Samsung Tool V0.7a is a firmware flashing utility for Samsung devices. It supports single and multi-file firmware flashing, customizable flashing scenarios, and advanced partition-level flashing with user-selected files.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ixQgXKrk--/f_auto/v1765340526/posts/Lhm998e2x?_a=BAMAK+ZW0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-10T04:22:06.393Z"},{"id":"GZoEYgC5s","title":"Phoenix Service Tool V8.1.2","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/phoenix-service-tool-v8-1-2-gzoeygc5s","summary":"Phoenix Service Tool version 8.1.2 has been released, offering mobile device flashing and FRP (Factory Reset Protection) bypass capabilities. The tool supports Tecno CM6 with Android 15, includes unlimited free flashing and FRP reset features, and works with preloader/BROM mode for device servicing.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--LwrVICv8--/f_auto/v1765340471/posts/GZoEYgC5s?_a=BAMAK+ZW0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-10T04:21:10.948Z"},{"id":"HI0EchN7H","title":"Domotic Tool Pro","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/domotic-tool-pro-hi0echn7h","summary":"Domotic Tool Pro is a GSM/mobile device utility that offers firmware modification capabilities, boot logo customization, and bloatware removal features. The tool appears designed for mobile device unlock